01:42:44.555 --> 01:42:47.958
TRANSGENDER DISTRICT WHO HAVE BEEN LEADING DOCUMENTATION,

01:42:47.958 --> 01:42:51.558
ADVOCACY AND PRESERVATION WORK FOR YEARS.

01:42:51.628 --> 01:42:55.632
COMMUNITY LEADERSHIP FROM THE TRANSGENDER DISTRICT INCLUDING

01:42:55.632 --> 01:42:56.900
BRIANNA MCCREE HAS HELPED CENTER THE IMPORTANCE OF

01:42:56.900 --> 01:43:00.570
